":"An official oral-argument transcript was verified.","status":"argued"},{"changed_at":"2026-08-29T23:57:55.030146Z","explanation":"An official Court opinion was verified.","status":"decided"}],"case_status":"decided","dek":"Grants Pass wants to enforce camping bans. Johnson argues the Eighth Amendment forbids punishing homelessness when shelter is unavailable.","dek_sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 132, lines 19-37","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-175_20f4.pdf","page_label":"file page 132, lines 19-37"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 141, lines 17-51","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-175_20f4.pdf","page_label":"file page 141, lines 17-51"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 168, lines 27-35","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-175_20f4.pdf","page_label":"file page 168, lines 27-35"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 23-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-175_20f4.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 23-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 67, lines 29-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-175_20f4.pdf","page_label":"file page 67, lines 29-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 73, lines 31-41","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/23-175_20f4.pdf","page_label":"file page 73, lines 31-41"}],"dispositions":[],"latest_court_document_date":"2024-04-22T00:00:00Z","maturity":"post_opinion","official_detail_url":"https://www.supre